      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T17:27:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I deleted \"(APK)\".\nI\u0027m actually unsure what to do here. We only use the context to provide a helpful default for apkPath; perhaps we could just require that - although it\u0027s a tiny bit more work for the caller, and getPackageCodePath() has a comment saying apps shouldn\u0027t generally use it.",
