        "id": 1432579
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-21T18:02:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is actually a required parameter, right? If so, we can make this a compile-time enforcement by providing two static factory methods, e.g.:\n\npublic static Builder forProtectedVm(...)\npublic static Builder forUnprotectedVm(...)\n\nI know that guidelines say that all required fields must go in c-tor (https://g3doc.corp.google.com/company/teams/android-api-council/guidelines/index.md?cl\u003dhead#builders), but there were some recent discussions that allowed using static factory methods (e.g. b/254863212)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 442,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 442,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "21e6997129ad4a4442afe3688f4e1c77307d25be",
